| 59,101 | 5959 | \(+,+\) | 3,3 | 9 | 6000 | 0 |
| 13,59 | 767 | \(+,+\) | 0,3 | 0 | 1140 | 0 |
| 13,29 | 377 | \(+,+\) | 0,0 | 0 | 703 | 1 |
| 5,7 | 35 | \(-,-\) | 1,1 | 1 | 32 | 0 |

**PROVED by finite computation — coefficient elimination.** For \(y^2=x^3+x+1\),
\[
(p,q,N)=(101,127,12827),\quad(a,b)=(-3,2),
\]
\[
A=-6,\quad B=11316,\quad S=1547.
